-- Phong Than 2026-10-05 (agent nuoithu): "Nuoi thu" - food for the pets. Generated by scratchpad\nuoithu\gen.py,
-- do not edit by hand. Doc: docs\features\nuoi-thu-phong-than-20261005.md
-- No main() here. Included by the Lenh Bai Hanh Trang row "Nuoi thu" (hanhtrang_lenhbai.lua PTHT_NuoiThu) and by
-- the two food item scripts; dofile'd into the servertimer state by the web admin (PTNT_AdminFeed).
--  * Linh thu (sinhhoat sh_lib.lua PTLT_*): exp per pet (tasks 2392..2399), level cap = stage x 10, no hunger.
--    Food: Linh Thu Don 6/1/61379 (+30, existing, PTLT_FOOD_EXP) and Linh Thu Dai Don 6/1/61551 (+300, new).
--  * De tu Di Nhan (lib\petexp_lib.lua PTPE_*): level 1..10 (task 2505), exp inside the level (task 2506), no
--    hunger. Food: De Tu Linh Don 6/1/61550 (+1000, new). Profession 2 (Di Nhan) only.
--  * Thu cuoi: the engine has no hunger or exp for mounts, nothing to feed.
--  * Daily food (task 2646 = yyyymmdd of the last claim): 20 Linh Thu Don for everyone, 10 De Tu Linh Don more
--    for Di Nhan. No hunger anywhere, so there is no automatic feeding.
-- Food is taken from the bag only (DelNormalItem), never from the store box. Lua 4: no true/false, no local
-- function; menus <= 7 rows, rows < 100 bytes.

PTNT_I_LTDON = 61379
PTNT_I_DTDON = 61550
PTNT_I_LTDAI = 61551
